ida, d\ando a tal as habilidades de manipula&#231;&#227;o de luz e imunidade a altera&#231;&#245;es em sua vis&#227;o \(poder enxergar no escuro absoluto ou n&#227;o ser afetado por flashes\). Ao se concentrar segurando o item, ela tamb&#233;m pode brilhar para \servir de lanterna.</span></p></body>)/Rect[180.873 653.301 519.057 711.812]/Subj(Text Box)/Subtype/FreeText/T( )/Type/Annot>>endobj51 0 obj<</BS<</W 0>>/CA 1/Contents(                                                                                                         Anotações\r)/DA(0 0 0 RG 0 0 0 rg 0 Tc 0 Tw 100 Tz 0 TL 0 Ts 0 Tr /Helv 17.1 Tf)/DS(font: Helvetica,sans-serif 17.1pt; text-align:left; color:#000000 )/F 4/M(D:20240907221411-03'00')/NM(5f15e8eb9fc54a00959a0547e7205bd6)/Page 3/RC(<?xml version="1.0"?><body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" xmlns:xfa="http://www.xfa.org/schema/xfa-data/1.0/" xfa:APIVersion="Acrobat:24.3.0" xfa:spec="2.0.2"  style="font-size:17.1pt;text-align:left;color:#000000;font-weight:normal;font-style:norma\l;font-family:Helvetica,sans-serif;font-stretch:normal"><p dir="ltr"><span style="font-family:Helvetica">                                                                                                         Anota&#231;&#245;es&#13;</span></p></body>)/Rect[255.579 669.124 342.052 727.274]/Subj(Text Box)/Subtype/FreeText/T( )/Type/Annot>>endobj52 0 obj<</BS<</W 0>>/CA 1/Contents(Não podem ser assimilados como Aprestos.)/DA(0 0 0 RG 0 0 0 rg /Helv 10 Tf)/DS(font: Helvetica,sans-serif 10.0pt; text-align:left; color:#000000 )/F 4/M(D:20240909182544-03'00')/NM(d22bedd642ee4046b0d883ddb2b6cb22)/Page 3/RC(<?xml version="1.0"?><body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" xmlns:xfa="http://www.xfa.org/schema/xfa-data/1.0/" xfa:APIVersion="Acrobat:24.3.0" xfa:spec="2.0.2"  style="font-size:10.0pt;text-align:left;color:#000000;font-weight:normal;font-style:norma\l;font-family:Helvetica,sans-serif;font-stretch:normal"><p dir="ltr"><span style="font-family:Helvetica"